{"name":"-54-O-13","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"533","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Carriage F01 (VIP-class carriage), Intercontinental Railway train \"Future\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21winter_avg_mahaline","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hisss— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The purification system is functioning normally... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It is only by hearing that sound that Lucas can tell that he is indeed aboard the \"Future\". "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Otherwise, he'd be asleep. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Since they don't know how much longer they'll be here, they've shut down all other sources of power consumption other than the purification system. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even after a terrifying round of shelling, nobody has anything to say. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They aren't even wailing and bemoaning their fate. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What everyone is waiting for is the dawn."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Excuse me, Lucas.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you have any sweets?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"