{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He's done a lot for Rosita, could you please let him rest a little?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I apologize.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I do not intend to disturb Dr. Rugosa.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's just that Rosita hasn't eaten for an entire day... I'm worried about her.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Hypoglycemia isn't a high-priority condition, and he hasn't been this tired for a long time!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Her fever just broke, and I'm worried her body won't be able to take it.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't know how much longer we must wait, so I'm feeling a little anxious.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm sorry.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I just can't find anything that can immediately replenish her blood sugar.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh yes, there's one more thing I must trouble you with.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Go ahead.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"529","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Carriage F02 (first-class carriage), Intercontinental Railway train \"Future\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pavel mulls over how to phrase his words as he sits on the floor. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He keeps entering letters, then deleting them, and only after going back and forth many times does he finally hit the \"enter\" key."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I bought an ampoule of \"Idunn\" on the Colt Express. ","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I would like to pay for the serum that the doctor used on Rosita with it.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Idunn???","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, I know that the ampoule won't ever be enough to make up for everything the doctor has done for Rosita...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't mean it as a compensation...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No, no, no, I do have to compensate the doctor...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My apologies. I am not good with words.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I am very grateful to the Doctor, so I would like to express my gratitude. However, I have nothing to give other than what I've obtained from the black market.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Do you have any idea what you're saying?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Galatea's stopped producing it. Idunn is now priceless.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's even more expensive than that serum.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Then that is as it should be...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But I don't think the doctor will accept it. That's just how he is.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then please help me hand it to the Doctor.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll send you the transaction code. Please contact Quimby for collection.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ah, I suddenly remember something that might be of use in Carriage 2.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You can try looking for it if you have night vision. There is a metal case under the doctor's seat that contains some lokum.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you find it, think of a way to get it in here. I'll help you feed it to Rosita.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm not trying to compensate you either!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't get the wrong idea!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't thank me too soon. It might have been ruined by the impact and the bombardment.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is lokum the same rose-flavored candy from the Chronicles of Narnia?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You know about it?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah. Rosita likes it a lot.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So does Dr. Rugosa.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'll try to find it.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Boy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lucas","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You'll find it faster if you have a magnet. It's a candy box made of steel.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pavel hangs up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Maggie, do you have a magnet?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nope. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why, going to play with magnets?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, I'm looking for a metal box."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're going to look for a metal box inside a ruined carriage? Who do you think you are, VALL-E? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Well, I guess they just fired off a few rounds of shellfire outside, so there's nothing much for us to do besides entertain ourselves. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unfortunately, I don't have one. Maybe you could try looking inside Susanna's workroom."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you. I'll try searching for it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Drink_Tea","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie has produced two intact wine glasses out of nowhere. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She places the glasses on the floor, then picks up a somewhat dirty shaker and wipes it off with her sleeve."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_2","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Meanwhile, Erma is curled up into a ball opposite Maggie as she watches her in a daze. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The whole place is a mess, and only the spot where they're seated is anything close to tidy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aren't you sad?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh yes, I am. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There's only half a bottle of gin left."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I mean— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"About Catherine. And Lyudmila. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Their signals are completely gone... I don't even know if we'll have a chance to recover their cores."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rather than sitting around and waxing melancholy for no reason... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't you think you have something more meaningful to do?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...But what can you do now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_va_addingredient","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie opens the shaker and pours the drink into the glasses. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Although they're a little dirty, she drops an olive into each of them. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie then pushes a glass in front of Erma."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm doing one of the most important things in my life—mixing a drink. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is the first time I've tried mixing something like this. Give it a try."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma wraps herself up more tightly with her cape, trying to refuse the d